<title>USA: Westvaco sets $150 mln in 30-year debentures.</title>
<headline>Westvaco sets $150 mln in 30-year debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Westvaco Corp was priced via lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, dealers said Thursday.</p>
<p>Westvaco is a New York-based company specializing in bleached board and high-end coated papers, products with better printing characteristics than commodity grades.</p>
<p>BORROWER WESTVACO CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.50  PCT  MATURITY 6/15/27</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.902  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 7.508 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P     A     SPREAD  76 BPS    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1675</p>
